<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Teco 1st-half net down 18.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Teco 1st-half net down 18.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-June 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				10,880   vs    10,942</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 1,302   vs     1,671</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1,121   vs     1,368</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in single T$) 1.55   vs	2.49</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Teco Electric and Machinery Co Lte, one of Taiwan's leading electric appliance and electric machinery makers.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
